Original pixel-art sprites in this directory were drawn for MetroForge
(Foundry visual slice) using a local Python/Pillow construction script.

Copyright 2026 MetroForge authors.
License: you may use, copy, modify, and distribute these sprites, including
commercially, with or without attribution.

No third-party sprite packs, paid APIs, or hosted image models were used.
Pillow is used only as a local rasterizer (HPND / PIL Software License).
